    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d776">

                <pb facs="1177" n="1163" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg1163"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">895.50 Recovery/8–1248</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Executive Secretary of the National Security
                        Council</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Souers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to President Truman
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d776-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-04-02">April 2, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    NSC 8</p>
                <p>At its 9th meeting the National Security Council considered the reference report
                    by the State-Army-Navy-Air Force Coordinating <pb facs="1178" n="1164"
                        xml:id="pg1164"/> Committee<anchor n="2" xml:id="d776-f2"/> and adopted it
                    subject to amendment of paragraph 3-<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>-(1). The
                    amended report is enclosed herewith.</p>
                <p>The National Security Council recommends that the President approve the
                    conclusions contained herein, and direct that they be implemented by all
                    appropriate Executive Departments and Agencies of the U.S. Government under the
                    coordination of the Secretary of State.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sidney</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Souers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d776-a1.xml" xpointer="d776-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d776-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d776-f1-content">
                <p>Submitted also to the Secretaries of State, Defense, Army, Navy, and Air Force
                    and to the Chairman of the National Security Resources Board.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d776-f2" n="2" xml:id="d776-f2-content">
                <p>
                    SANACC 176/39.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
